# Android release APK — served from public/download/ (nginx sets the
# application/vnd.android.package-archive type) but the ~170 MB signed binary is
# never committed to git: each site build fetches it from the release bucket by
# the SHA-256 the /download/android page shows (cloudbuild.deploy.yaml). The QR
# SVG and the version manifest under public/ ARE committed.
public/download/*.apk
